&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;For student &amp;amp; internship positions, we have an adjusted set of benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;You can find them &lt;a href=&quot;https://moia.box.com/s/f5uk70exr7jkjogchta0hzhdlz0wh3ae&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Be who you are!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We are a member of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.charta-der-vielfalt.de/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Charta der Vielfalt&lt;/a&gt; and are dedicated to actively fostering a workplace that celebrates and promotes diversity in various aspects such as age, gender identity, race, sexual orientation, physical or cognitive ability, and ethnicity. At MOIA, we embrace a culture where people are accepted, respected, valued, appreciated, and included.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;In our commitment to promoting diversity and inclusivity, we regularly provide unconscious bias training to all our employees. Furthermore, we continuously strive to enhance our hiring process by ensuring a diverse hiring panel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;How we work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;At MOIA, our teams are typically distributed across our office locations and collaborate in a hybrid setup. We work together both remotely and on site, choosing the mode of collaboration that fits the context, the work at hand, and each team’s rhythm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Spending time together in our offices is an important part of how we stay connected, build trust, and solve complex problems. At the same time, we value flexibility and give teams and individuals autonomy to shape their ways of working, with everyone having the freedom to organise their routines in a way that aligns with their work and their team’s needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;If you’d like to learn more about how we work, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://moiadev.medium.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt; for insights into our culture and &lt;a href=&quot;https://moiadev.medium.com/how-we-hire-at-moia-a-look-inside-our-hiring-process-da86b45016a5&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;hiring process&lt;/a&gt;, or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatmoia/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; for a look behind the scenes at MOIA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;At MOIA we’re reimagining the future of mobility – safe, autonomous and tailored to the needs of cities and their people. As a tech company with more than 400 employees, we build mobility solutions that truly move cities forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We launched our ridepooling service in Hamburg in 2019 and have been part of the city’s public transport system since 2023. Since launch, we have transported over 12 million passengers. Currently, MOIA is evolving from a mobility provider to a tech provider offering a scalable and safe &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/POHpzaR965A?si=Dbd_GzWjWyPLS_JV&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;turnkey solution for autonomous driving&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;With office locations in Berlin and Hamburg, our diverse and international team comprising more than 60 nationalities works together toward that shared mission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;MOIA is more than a technology provider – we are a partner to cities and public transport operators committed to creating more livable spaces and delivering mobility solutions that are reliable, safe and comfortable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Your application to MOIA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We value authenticity and personal insights in your application responses. While AI tools can be useful, we encourage you to answer the following questions based on your own experiences and understanding. This helps us keep a human touch and better evaluate your unique perspective and match for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;To reinforce an unbiased screening process, we kindly ask you not to include your picture, age, address, or any other details unrelated to your qualifications and suitability for the role. Additionally, we anonymize applications during the initial review phase by removing personally identifiable information. This ensures that our evaluation focuses solely on your skills, experience, and potential – supporting a fair and inclusive hiring experience for all candidates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our growing User Experience team is looking for a Staff Product Designer &amp;amp; Researcher generalist to help evolve the developer experience on Netlify in collaboration with a diverse group of cross-functional partners in engineering, developer education, product management, support, marketing, and sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a critical member of our UX Team, you’ll keep our users at the center of your process and balance near- and long-term initiatives that drive us toward building a better web. With our team, you’ll share and collaborate early and often, driving and facilitating meaningful discussion with a blend of in-person and async transparent communication. You’ll lead initiatives ranging from iterative feature improvements to explorations with high ambiguity that demand innovation. There’s plenty to do, so be ready to roll up your sleeves to help shape our team and raise the quality of developer and team experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your prior experience to lead projects toward user and business solutions and drive the design work and team from research to full-realized features and flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and other partners to represent the UX team, build bridges, facilitate design or research kickoffs and discussions, and drive the user experience forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our design system and processes, including accessibility practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your team with thoughtful feedback and shape how we tell customer experience stories at Netlify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage participant recruiting, participant followups, and incentives disbursement for all studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicate findings and recommendations to product teams and stakeholders that surface recommendations and implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product stakeholders to test business requirements using heuristic/qualitative methods, in a rapid way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong async communication rhythms with your peers and leaders, practicing transparency and visibility in your progress against areas of focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our expanding research practice and run usability tests in collaboration with research partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize around multiple work streams, including prioritizing, iterating, and timeboxing work as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create structure where there is ambiguity, can quickly adapt to organizational change and workstream shifts, and can help others navigate staffing and priority changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of leading design efforts at a strategic level for technical products, platforms, or systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency at iterating &amp;amp; circulating concepts with peers and building toward high-confidence proposals, effectively prototyping and storytelling at various fidelities throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A breadth of experience in the iterative product development process, from problem definition, information architecture, and UX flows to interaction and UI design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of comfort in working with developers in the presentation layer (for example, HTML, CSS) and is well-versed in using tools such as Figma and GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigor for accessibility, consistency, and high standard of quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent autonomy and a drive to thrive in a cross-disciplinary and collaborative environment&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;with product and engineering teams, where colleagues teach and learn from one another.Growth mindset: curious and open to new technologies, methodologies, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in research operations including managing a participant database and setting up studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership in scoping, planning, and executing usability research studies, with minimal support and guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome, but not required: other experience such as iconography, branding, front-end engineering, or content design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We don’t have educational requirements for roles at Netlify, so whether you went to a school or are self-taught, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We welcome candidates based in the US and Canada for this position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our applications will close on Friday, August-7th at 5pm ET&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applying&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet 100% of our qualifications? &lt;strong&gt;Please apply anyway!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When applying please include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A resume or short listing of your job history &amp;amp; skills (link to a LinkedIn profile would be fine). We appreciate a cover letter explaining why you would enjoy working in this role at Netlify to get to know you a bit better, though this is not required and will not impact your application. Our mission is to “build a better web” and that cannot be done without a diversity of skill sets, backgrounds and thoughts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Of everything we&#39;ve ever built at Netlify, we are most proud of our team. Netlify is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We are devoted to building a team of people with diverse backgrounds and lifestyles. Driving equality empowers our team, enables us to innovate, and helps us maintain a more inclusive environment. We don’t discriminate against employees or applicants based on gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, race, military/veteran status, citizenship, pregnancy status, or any other differences. If we can do anything to provide a better interview, i.e. accommodate a disability, then please let us know by emailing &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accomodations@netlify.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@netlify.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Netlify&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netlify is the most popular way to build, deploy, and scale modern web applications, empowering everyone from fast moving solo developers to enterprise teams. Millions of developers and organizations rely on Netlify as their platform of choice for composing web applications that are production ready, performant, and flexible. Now, as we embrace the next era of software development, we are embedding the same fluid, intuitive experience into the Agent Experience (AX), making it just as simple for intelligent agents to understand, interact with, and act on our platform as it is for developers. Whether your user is human or machine, Netlify ensures the path from idea to URL is seamless, fast, and deeply reliable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Series D company that has raised over $200M from investors such as Andreessen Horowitz, Kleiner Perkins, EQT, Bessemer, BOND, and Menlo Ventures. As a fully distributed company, we aim to create a company culture where the best idea can come from anywhere and strive to be thoughtful, compassionate, and collaborative in our work. If this sounds like something you’d like to be part of, we’re excited to connect with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Netlify, we are committed to a compensation philosophy that prioritizes fairness and equity, positions our employee compensation competitively in the market, recognizes and rewards performance, and takes a comprehensive approach to our rewards package. We anchor our compensation philosophy on a market-based approach, therefore salary ranges may differ depending on the labor cost in a particular location. The salary provided is in addition to robust benefits and participation in Netlify’s equity plan. Our hiring range for this role is targeted at $196,000 - $232,000 USD for most US-based locations or $197,000 - $232,000 CAD for most Canada-based locations. Candidates in premium markets should consult with their Talent Acquisition partner regarding location-based ranges, as they may be higher or lower than the average ranges listed. The starting pay will be determined based on multiple factors, including expertise and skills, market demands, experience, internal equity, and applicable geographic location. These compensation packages and ranges are subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://atolls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Atolls-Banner_01_Greenhouse_1400x200-scaled.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Atolls top banner&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atolls is the world’s largest community-driven shopping platform, active in 20+ markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We help millions make smarter spending decisions across discovery, evaluation, and (re-)purchase by connecting people with the right brands and retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Our 1,000+ team across 10 countries builds products used every day at global scale, where you’ll have real ownership and see your impact. Want to shape the destinations people rely on to shop with confidence? Keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section&gt;
&lt;section&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical SEO Manager to join our Marketing team in the Madrid Office. This position ensures the technical SEO integrity of our multilingual community commerce platform across nine international markets - like &lt;a href=&quot;http://mydealz.de&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;mydealz.de&lt;/a&gt;, hotukdeals, and more. It combines classic Technical SEO with solid AI, data, and automation skills to ensure that indexing, category, and reporting workflows are scalable and not manual.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your contributions will help shape how millions of consumers interact with our platforms, guiding them to make smart, fair, and rewarding choices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Atolls, we believe in nurturing both your professional and personal growth. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that values personal and professional development, with internal mobility opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive and open-minded team that embraces diverse perspectives and innovative ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;32 days of paid vacation plus your birthday off, giving you the time you need to recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible hybrid working scheme to balance work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a learning budget and internal training to help you grow in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health coaching to support your well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular global and local get-togethers to celebrate successes and build connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The possibility of taking a sabbatical after three years with the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cloud-based company setup, providing flexibility and collaboration opportunities no matter where you are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*These are global benefits that apply to all employees, with additional local perks based on your location.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Conduct technical audits, crawl/log-file analyses, and manage indexation (noindex, canonicals, robots.txt) to resolve issues on a platform with large URL volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically advance our Entity Optimization and Semantic Search capabilities through structured data (Schema.org) and internal linking to build a machine-readable Knowledge Graph.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical readiness of the platform for generative search engines (GEO) and AI-powered answers (AIO), including managing AI crawlers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and automate internal tools, apps, and monitoring workflows using an AI-first approach with tools like Claude, Lovable, v0, Cursor, and n8n.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish workflows to measure and analyze our visibility within AI answers and translate SEO goals into actionable technical requirements for Product &amp;amp; Tech teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone with deep experience in technical SEO for large-scale websites, who has a proven ability to leverage AI and automation to create scalable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with Screaming Frog, GSC, Ahrefs/SISTRIX/SEMrush; HTML/CSS, JS rendering, Schema.org;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of entity-based search and Knowledge Graphs; AI-first building with LLMs (Claude, Lovable, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Dashboarding, database experience, programmatic SEO, and experience building agent/tooling infrastructures (n8n).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience isolating platform-wide patterns and algorithmic anomalies across all markets, distinguishing business impact from digital noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systematically dissects root causes when algorithms change, finding creative workarounds where standard tools reach their limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating highly complex technical SEO dependencies into clear business value for Product Owners and developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently identifies and prioritizes high-impact actions and documents workflows to ensure team resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, both written and spoken in English; any other language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA Call&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet one of our Talent Experts and get to know Atolls better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Round&lt;/strong&gt;: Focus on the technical aspects of the role &lt;em&gt;(Through a Live Case)&lt;/em&gt;, and meet your potential manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Round&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet other Atollians 🏝️&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It varies from 1 to 3 interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Some processes might slightly change according to needs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a destination where your work helps millions of people make better decisions every day.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;One focused application is all we need. If you truly fit more than one role, you’re welcome to apply to &lt;strong&gt;up to three. &lt;/strong&gt;This helps us match you with the right opportunity faster.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We review every application with equal care and will reach out if your profile aligns. Apply now with your CV in English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Portfolios, writing samples, or certifications may be requested based on the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-RB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Atolls, we want to ensure that all employees can thrive in an inclusive environment. Our employment opportunities are open to every gender, race, religion, age, sexual orientation, ability, place of origin, or socioeconomic status. We remain committed to a culture of diversity, equity and belonging, where all employees are welcomed, respected, connected, and engaged.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://atolls.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Email-banner-bottom-2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Atolls bottom banner&quot; width=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über uns: Wer/Was ist Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact ist eine weltweit führende Beratung für Daten- und KI-Dienstleistungen mit Hauptsitz in Paris. Mit mehr als 2.000 Consultants, Data Scientists und Engineers in 26 Ländern arbeiten wir mit den globalen Marktführern zusammen. An unseren deutschen Standorten befinden wir uns auf einem rasanten Wachstumskurs. Wir beraten führende nationale und internationale Kunden branchenübergreifend dabei, das volle Potenzial ihrer Daten auszuschöpfen, skalierbare Datenarchitekturen aufzubauen und innovative KI-Lösungen zu implementieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant (m/w/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; stehst du im Mittelpunkt dieser Mission. Du lieferst nicht nur statische Präsentationen, sondern schlägst die Brücke zwischen technologischen Möglichkeiten und geschäftlichen Anforderungen. Dabei begleitest du unsere Kunden von fokussierten Kurzzeit-Projekten im gehobenen Mittelstand bis hin zu mehrphasigen KI-Transformationen in Großkonzernen. In dieser Rolle übernimmst du die Verantwortung für crossfunktionale Workstreams, treibst datenbasierte Entscheidungen voran und gestaltest die digitale Zukunft unserer Kunden aktiv mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich bei uns:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Strategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Du arbeitest eng mit (internationalen) Kunden zusammen, verstehst deren geschäftliche Anforderungen und übersetzt diese in datengestützte Empfehlungen, die strategische Entscheidungen und die Business Transformation unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten &amp;amp; Analyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Du sammelst, strukturierst und bereitest Daten für Analysen auf. Mit Tools wie Excel, SQL und Python identifizierst du Trends, Muster und konkrete Handlungsempfehlungen und kommunizierst diese klar an technische sowie nicht-technische Stakeholder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektumsetzung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für Projekt-Workstreams und stellst eine qualitativ hochwertige, termingerechte Lieferung im Einklang mit den übergeordneten Projektzielen sicher. Dabei arbeitest du kollaborativ in interdisziplinären Teams aus den Bereichen Consulting, Data und Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Lösungen:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt die Entwicklung von Datenstrategien, KI-Use-Cases sowie Business-Intelligence-Lösungen und wirkst bei Governance-Frameworks und Implementierungs-Roadmaps mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wissenstransfer &amp;amp; Kollaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trägst zu einer starken Teamkultur bei, indem du dein Wissen teilst, dich über digitale Trends und KI-Entwicklungen auf dem Laufenden hältst und die kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung des Teams unterstützt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im Kern definieren wir uns über eine Kultur der Eigenverantwortung, der intellektuellen Neugier und der Zusammenarbeit. Wir suchen motivierte, fähige und umsichtige Talente, die hungrig auf neue Herausforderungen sind und die Chance nutzen wollen, zu lernen und zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufserfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verfügst über mindestens 2-3 Jahre Erfahrung in der Management-/Datenberatung oder in einer entsprechenden Inhouse-Funktion. Zudem bringst du nachweisbare Erfolge in den Bereichen Daten-/KI-Strategie, Cloud-Transformation oder angewandte KI-/Machine-Learning-Projekte mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daten- &amp;amp; KI-Verständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Du besitzt eine hohe Affinität für Datenmanagement und moderne KI-Technologien. Konzepte wie Generative KI, LLMs oder Predictive Analytics sind dir vertraut und du brennst darauf, die Lücke zwischen Business-Anforderungen und KI-Einsatz zu schließen. Idealerweise hast du bereits Erfahrung in der Konzeption von KI-Use-Cases oder im Data-Platform-Tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Orientierung &amp;amp; analytisches Denken:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verbindest ausgeprägte analytische Fähigkeiten mit einer geschäftsorientierten Denkweise. Es macht dir Spaß, geschäftliche Herausforderungen zu identifizieren und sie in praktische, KI- und datengestützte Lösungen zu übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technische Fähigkeiten:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist sicher im Umgang mit Excel und PowerPoint. Praktische Erfahrung mit Statistik-Tools, BI-Software oder Programmiersprachen wie SQL, R oder Python zur Datenexploration und -aufbereitung ist ein klares Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Du kommunizierst komplexe technische Themen sowohl auf Deutsch als auch auf Englisch klar und verständlich. Du arbeitest gerne in interdisziplinären Teams und schätzt die Zusammenarbeit über verschiedene Ebenen und Funktionen hinweg (z. B. als Übersetzer der Anforderungen zwischen Business-Stakeholdern und Data Scientists).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönlichkeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Du agierst proaktiv, strukturiert sowie lösungsorientiert und zeichnest dich durch eine ausgeprägte Kunden- und Stakeholder-Orientierung aus. Du blühst in dynamischen Umfeldern auf und hast Freude daran, komplexe Probleme zu lösen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse sind eine Grundvoraussetzung. Du wirst an Kunden-Workshops teilnehmen, Präsentationen vor hochrangigen Entscheidungsträgern halten und Dokumente in beiden Sprachen verfassen. Weitere Sprachkenntnisse sind von Vorteil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeitserlaubnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine gültige Arbeitserlaubnis für Deutschland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einflussreiche Kundenprojekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Arbeite an anspruchsvollen Projekten mit führenden nationalen und internationalen Kunden in den Bereichen Daten, Digitalisierung und zukunftsweisende Datenstrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Karriere- und Entwicklungschancen:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir glauben an Leistung, nicht an Dienstalter. Dein Aufstieg wird durch deinen Impact bestimmt, nicht durch deine Betriebszugehörigkeit - mit klaren Aufstiegsmöglichkeiten und vielfältigen Karriereperspektiven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attraktive Vergütung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein starkes Vergütungspaket inklusive eines leistungsabhängigen Bonus, der halbjährlich ausgezahlt wird.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lernen &amp;amp; Weiterentwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Werde Teil eines Teams aus passionierten Data Consultants, die sich gegenseitig aktiv unterstützen. Du lernst durch vielfältige Projekte, enge Zusammenarbeit und den Austausch mit führenden Experten der Branche - internationale Einsätze eingeschlossen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilität &amp;amp; Freizeit:&lt;/strong&gt; Unbegrenztes Homeoffice und flexible Arbeitszeiten, 28 Tage Jahresurlaub sowie zusätzliche freie Tage über die Feiertage (Weihnachten und Silvester frei) und an deinem Geburtstag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
